%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as Trigger<br/>(manual / schedule / backfill)
  participant RT as POST /api/sync/[id]/start
  participant SR as lib/sync/start-run.ts
  participant G as Regional Glue
  participant S as Regional<br/>S3 Tables / Redshift
  participant DDB as bgp-task-runs
  participant OM as OpenMetadata
  T->>RT: Start (optionally with a business date)
  RT->>RT: workspace guard · place-stamp reverse check<br/>cross-region read 409<br/>channel decision (glue / dms / zero-etl)<br/>
  RT->>SR: startGlueSyncRun
  SR->>SR: resolveGlueBinding (place:<br/>region · scripts bucket · role<br/>table bucket / workgroup)<br/>
  SR->>G: ensureGlueSyncJob: generateGlueScript<br/>→ PutObject to scripts bucket → CreateJob / UpdateJob
  SR->>SR: adoptExistingTargetsOnce<br/>(upgrade compatibility: record existing target tables)<br/>
  SR->>G: StartJobRun (Arguments = 15 business-date variables)
  SR->>DDB: putRunRecord(running, triggeredBy)
  G->>S: PySpark: read source (JDBC via Glue connection)<br/>→ write Iceberg table (s3tablescatalog) or Redshift
  SR->>G: background polling GetJobRun
  SR->>DDB: updateRunRecord (status · row metrics parseSyncRunMetrics)
  SR->>OM: pushSyncToOpenMetadata<br/>(source / target entities + column-level lineage, per-region service)
  SR->>SR: fireDownstreamOnce<br/>(trigger dependent downstream)<br/>
